    <description>This package is deprecated as of Studio 23.10. 
Integration Service Connectors can now be used directly from the Project's Activities panel or Package Manager under All Connectors.

THIS VERSION REQUIRES THE CLOUD INTEGRATION SERVICE. UiPath Integration Service based automation activities for Smartsheet. These activities allow you to execute create, retrieve, update and delete operations on Smartsheet objects.</description>
